            "action_description": {
              "value": "(enchantment, manipulate, mental, occult)\n\nRequirements: The blood painter is within reach of an enemy taking persistent bleed damage\n\nThe blood painter touches the creature and applies blood to one of their four claws; the blood remains fresh for 1 minute. The target must succeed at a 28 Will save or become fascinated with the blood painter."
